    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ploko, a VR adventure full of creativity and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d BUILD MINIATURE WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where <i>you\u2019re the creator</i>. Enjoy piecing together enchanting dioramas that come to life in themed landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.poster.avif?t=1740383290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.webm?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.mp4?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf7 CAPTURE MOMENTS AND UNCOVER SECRETS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Polaroid camera, aim, snap\u2026 and sometimes, Ploko himself has hidden surprises waiting in your photos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.poster.avif?t=1740383290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.webm?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.mp4?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f FOLLOW CLUES TO UNVEIL STORIES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama hides a mysterious story only you can reveal. Solve the photo challenges to learn more about Ploko\u2019s secret life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f EXPLORE A VARIETY OF ATHMOSPHERES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From serene Japanese gardens to bustling city streets, each level has its own unique style and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e A FELINE COMPANION\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploko, your friendly sidekick, accompanies you on your adventure, adding warmth and mystery to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 EXPRESS YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing relaxation and wonder, Ploko immerses you in a unique VR experience where each diorama invites you to dream.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ploko, a VR adventure full of creativity and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d BUILD MINIATURE WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a universe where <i>you\u2019re the creator</i>. Enjoy piecing together enchanting dioramas that come to life in themed landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.poster.avif?t=1740383290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.webm?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/f353194351802f4a3bed1db85c6305a5.mp4?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf7 CAPTURE MOMENTS AND UNCOVER SECRETS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Polaroid camera, aim, snap\u2026 and sometimes, Ploko himself has hidden surprises waiting in your photos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.poster.avif?t=1740383290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.webm?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488250/extras/a95227871d9af48b4b37b76e474b4be6.mp4?t=1740383290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f FOLLOW CLUES TO UNVEIL STORIES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama hides a mysterious story only you can reveal. Solve the photo challenges to learn more about Ploko\u2019s secret life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f EXPLORE A VARIETY OF ATHMOSPHERES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From serene Japanese gardens to bustling city streets, each level has its own unique style and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e A FELINE COMPANION\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploko, your friendly sidekick, accompanies you on your adventure, adding warmth and mystery to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 EXPRESS YOUR CREATIVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing relaxation and wonder, Ploko immerses you in a unique VR experience where each diorama invites you to dream.</p>",
    "short_description": "Ploko is a relaxing VR experience where each model you build comes to life before your very eyes. With your camera, explore these miniature worlds, discover their hidden secrets and let your imagination run wild.",
